# Compiled binaries (Hasil kompilasi mikrokontroler)
*.o
*.bin
*.elf
*.hex
*.map
*.out
*.obj

# Trash / File Sampah Umum
*.bak
*.~*

# IAR Settings (Konfigurasi Workspace Lokal IAR)
**/settings/*.crun
**/settings/*.dbgdt
**/settings/*.cspy
**/settings/*.cspy.*
**/settings/*.xcl
**/settings/*.dni
**/settings/*.wsdt
**/settings/*.wspos
**/settings/

# IAR Output Directories (Sangat disarankan pakai **/ agar mencakup semua sub-folder)
**/Debug/
**/Release/
**/Exe/*.sim
**/Obj/

# IAR Backup & Dependency files
Backup*
*.dep

# Mengabaikan file konfigurasi folder Windows di semua tingkat folder
**/desktop.ini
**/Thumbs.db

# Mengabaikan file sistem Mac (jika proyek dibuka di Mac suatu saat nanti)
**/.DS_Store

# Tambahkan folder dependency/hasil build Anda di bawah ini (opsional)
# node_modules/
# .env